Package: aurora-sensor-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12)
Maintainer: Aurora Clinic <noreply@example.com>
Description: Aurora Clinic cold-chain sensor agent
 IoT agent for a clinic medical fridge: it samples the temperature/humidity
 sensor, detects cold-chain excursions locally, buffers readings while offline,
 and publishes them to the Aurora backend over MQTT with an HTTP fallback.
 Installs as a systemd service. The agent and its Python dependencies are
 vendored under /opt/aurora-sensor-agent/lib (no network needed at install).
